      "description": "A charming and characterful Victorian three bedroom semi-detached house located in the highly desirable Headington area. The ground floor comprises a front reception room with original bay window and feature fireplace, leading to a generous open-plan kitchen diner with garden views, plus a convenient downstairs WC and cloakroom. On the first floor are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a contemporary family bathroom. There is a boarded loft with pull-down ladder and light, providing superb storage or conversion potential subject to consents. Outside boasts a block-paved driveway providing off-street parking for 2 vehicles, and an attractive south-facing rear garden with stone patio and lawn. The property is offered chain-free with no onward chain."
